    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you're telling me i *should* argue that? i thought i was supposed to be looking at both sides fairly for my report. if the economic impact is as bad for small businesses as some people say, how do you justify telling me to prioritize the environmental side over their actual livelihoods?",
